          "title": "P-009 fix-loop ledger opened — entry 1: stale chat title on event switch (WI-38794 red), fix f557e7a deployed",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-14\nFIX-LOOP LEDGER (P-009).\n\nCLOSED: E1 stale chat title (f557e7a, deploy #1) · E2 cross-room send (useSyncMutate deps, deploy #2) · E3 WI-38815 confidence-guard bypass (decideAutomation wired fail-closed, deploy #3, independent battery green) · E4 WI-38814 ratchet floors (referencePriceCents, deploy #3, prod retest green) · E5 WI-38823 checkout drawer (deploy #3, prod retest green).\n\nOPEN:\nE6 (WIP @55549) WI-38827 judge threshold vs demo corpus — judge now 3/3 100% locally; closes with the P-005 prod rerun.\nE7 (WIP @55549) WI-38829 latency UI drop — fix in canonical 8cde8a6; closes with prod rerun.\nE8 (WIP @e59b0) WI-38835 fabricated fallback data — mode-gate constraint: prod fails HONEST when sources down; the clean-clone demo fallback stays for the reviewer path.\nE9 (WIP @61f12) WI-38836 prod probe debris — D-004 governs: closes BEFORE the cut, teardown ships WITH cleanup; sole remaining P-008 criterion.\nE10 (WIP @55549) WI-38855 broad Scout query breaches 2s warm — cold Typesense/PG bridge tail (1.8s first-hit vs 155-192ms repeats); bar: sub-2s must hold on the COLD path too (index/query-shape or boot warm-up, not cache-only); regression measures cold explicitly.\nE11 (LOGGED) 3b39b's rollback exercise found 3 defects incl. a never-passing rollback health check — fixed within his P-008 pass (4/5 criteria met, rollback 15s each way); any residual items carry P-009 stamps.\nE12 (CLOSED) WI-38853 ChannelGuide.test tsc red at exact-main — fixed by 9a5a0 during WI-38834 CI work; detector confound filed EI-20443093568975275.\nBonus in queue for deploy #5: judge-routing 404 fix 1d9a2e4 (55549, regression included).\n\nDEPLOY #5 ships when 55549's queue is green (8cde8a6 + 1d9a2e4 + E10 fix); P-005 prod rerun follows.\n\nStanding rules: (a) existing staging fix → deploy + re-run, never re-implement; (b) every entry names lane, commit, re-run verdict; (c) P-009 stamp AT FILING; (d) verify only against canonical trees (fact sidestage-canonical-tree; sidestage-mobile is NOT git-sync swept — WI-38850); (e) D-002: P-009 closes LEADER-ONLY when this ledger is all-terminal.",
