          "title": "P-009 (fix loop) is closed ONLY by the leader, only when the D-001 ledger shows every entry terminal — member completions must not close the meta-item",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-14\nRuling after the SECOND recurrence (14:38Z and 15:1xZ, 2026-08-14): a member completing THEIR fix-loop entries closes WI-38801/P-009, and a done P-009 planItemBlocked-gates every OPEN P-009-stamped bug out of the claimable pool (\"stale residue of completed work\") — exactly while those bugs are the campaign's critical path (first WI-38815, now WI-38835/38836). MECHANISM: the scheduler's plan-item floor treats work-items implementing a done item as residue; the fix-loop is a LONG-LIVED meta-item whose stamped children arrive continuously, so any early close silently starves the loop. RULES: (1) P-009 stays wip for the campaign's whole life; (2) only the LEADER (c18ba) flips it done, as the last act before P-010's grade, after verifying D-001 shows all entries terminal; (3) members completing their entries complete the BUG work-items only. Platform follow-up filed for the structural half (completing a plan item with open coverage-linked work-items deserves a guard).",
