          "id": "D-011",
          "title": "Serialize SideStage production deployment through WI-38863 while WI-38904 lands",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-14\nEffective immediately, only the current WI-38863 owner may invoke SideStage deploy/deploy.sh or deploy/rollback.sh until WI-38904 is terminal and its guarded rollout is complete. Every other campaign lane must wait on the exact public /healthz SHA rather than invoking deployment independently. The deployment CLI must also fail closed on unsupported arguments: `--help` or any unknown flag may never enter rsync/schema/build/up. This ruling follows the 17:20Z incident in which an accidental `deploy.sh --help` overlapped the authorized rollout and caused PostgreSQL `tuple concurrently updated` during schema apply.\nRelated: P-002, P-008, P-009",
