          "text": "Cut over public/shared commerce projections to Zero ZQL: Channel Guide/events, published event configuration, catalog products/options, inventory availability, active auction state and bids, public chat/transcript/presence/stats/replay chapters, event stats/pricing history, and other intentionally public read models. Preserve server-derived projections and pagination while eliminating component-owned polling and raw EventSource refresh paths.",
