          "text": "Cut over buyer-owned state to principal-scoped Zero queries and optimistic mutators: carts, reservations/expiry, checkout and order status, buyer-targeted offers, Scout sessions/transcripts/memory, and buyer identity continuity. Payment, shipping-rate, and AI-provider calls remain authoritative server commands, but their durable inputs/results/statuses must land in Postgres and return to every authorized client through Zero.",
