          "text": "Cut over seller-owned state to principal-scoped Zero queries and optimistic mutators: events.mine, drafts/configuration, event items and inventory, run of show, actions/offers/audits/rollback status, policies/outbox state, Copilot proposals, auction controls, and seller-facing operational views. Enforce ownership in both query resolution and mutation transactions using the identity plan's existing event/inventory authority.",
