          "id": "P-020",
          "text": "Define and implement the Zero boundary for operational, derived, and streaming surfaces: build history, readiness/rehearsal and judge results, system-test status, media-session metadata, and AI/chat streaming completion state. Persist durable client-visible results before syncing them; keep raw audio/video bytes, live WebRTC media, incremental model tokens, secrets, and third-party RPCs on their purpose-built transports while syncing their metadata, lifecycle, and final results through Zero.",
