          "text": "Retire parallel client data paths after every domain is green: all server-backed reads use useSyncQuery and all writes use useSyncMutate; REST exists only as the shared library's SSE/polling fallback or explicit command fallback, never as component-owned fetch state. Add a generated schema/publication/query/mutator census plus lint/contract tests that fail on unclassified tables, direct server-data fetches, raw EventSource query refresh, missing publication entries, missing authorization, or client/server Zero version drift.",
